PN,38201
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786717110
OL,3,CMajor travel disruption expected
OL,4,C'until further notice' after train
OL,5,Cderailment
OL,7,FThere is major travel disruption
OL,8,Facross Sussex after a train derailed
OL,9,Fnear Lewes yesterday afternoon,
OL,10,Fleaving two passengers seriously
OL,11,Finjured and a total of 20 people in
OL,12,Fhospital.
OL,14,FThe Southern train was travelling from
OL,15,FLondon Victoria to Eastbourne when it
OL,16,Fcame off the tracks just north of
OL,17,FLewes station tunnel.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/13
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786717110
OL,3,CMajor travel disruption expected
OL,4,C'until further notice' after train
OL,5,Cderailment
OL,7,FThree carriages came off the tracks
OL,8,Fand overturned, leaving dozens of
OL,9,Fpassengers trapped. Around 150 people
OL,10,Fhad been on board at the time and have
OL,11,Fsince all been evacuated.
OL,13,FToday, Southern said all lines between
OL,14,FLewes and Haywards Heath are closed.
OL,15,FTrains are unable to run between the
OL,16,Ftwo and will be cancelled.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/13
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786717110
OL,3,CMajor travel disruption expected
OL,4,C'until further notice' after train
OL,5,Cderailment
OL,7,FThe operator added that major
OL,8,Fdisruption is expected to continue
OL,9,Funtil further notice. The line will
OL,10,Fremain closed while investigations,
OL,11,Fdetails assessments and repairs are
OL,12,Fcarried out.
OL,14,FCustomers are being advised to use an
OL,15,Falternative route or a rail
OL,16,Freplacement bus, and to allow at least
OL,17,Fan extra 60 minutes of journey time.
OL,19,FRail replacement buses will be running
OL,20,Fbetween Haywards Heath and Lewes,
OL,21,Fcalling at Cooksbridge and Plumpton.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/13
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786717110
OL,3,CMajor travel disruption expected
OL,4,C'until further notice' after train
OL,5,Cderailment
OL,7,FBut the operator said this means fewer
OL,8,Ftravel options than normal for some
OL,9,Fcustomers.
OL,11,FThose travelling by train towards
OL,12,FEastbourne or Hastings will need to
OL,13,Fchange at Brighton to continue their
OL,14,Fjourney.
OL,16,FExtra carriages have been added to
OL,17,Fservices between Brighton and
OL,18,FHastings, and Brighton and Seaford
OL,19,Fwhere possible to support travel on
OL,20,Fthis route.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/13
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786717110
OL,3,CMajor travel disruption expected
OL,4,C'until further notice' after train
OL,5,Cderailment
OL,7,FCustomers are also being advised they
OL,8,Fmay be entitled to compensation if
OL,9,Fthey experience a delay in completing
OL,10,Ftheir journey today. They are being
OL,11,Ftold to keep their train ticket and
OL,12,Fmake a note of their journey.
OL,14,FSouthern says they are continuing to
OL,15,Fwork closely with their Network Rail
OL,16,Fpartners, whose engineers and
OL,17,Fspecialist teams are assessing the
OL,18,Fdamage and identifying the work needed
OL,19,Fbefore trains can safely run again.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/13
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786717110
OL,3,CMajor travel disruption expected
OL,4,C'until further notice' after train
OL,5,Cderailment
OL,7,FUntil the investigations, assessments
OL,8,Fand repairs are complete, some
OL,9,Fservices will be cancelled or changed,
OL,10,Fand journeys may take longer than
OL,11,Fusual.
OL,13,FThe operator added that replacement
OL,14,Ftransport is being provided where
OL,15,Fpossible to help people continue their
OL,16,Fjourney.
OL,18,FThey are urging people to check their
OL,19,Fjourney before travelling and thank
OL,20,Fthem for their patience.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/13
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786717110
OL,3,CMajor travel disruption expected
OL,4,C'until further notice' after train
OL,5,Cderailment
OL,7,FThe disruption will also have a knock-
OL,8,Fon effect for people travelling to the
OL,9,FEastbourne International Airshow this
OL,10,Fyear, taking place this Thursday to
OL,11,FSunday.
OL,13,FOn their Facebook page, the event
OL,14,Forganisers said trains are running
OL,15,Ffrom London to Eastbourne Via Brighton
OL,16,For Hastings - and that people should
OL,17,Fcheck for updates before they travel.
OL,19,FSouthern says they will provide
OL,20,Ffurther updates as more information
OL,21,Fbecomes available.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/13
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786717111
OL,3,CMajor travel disruption expected
OL,4,C'until further notice' after train
OL,5,Cderailment
OL,7,FElsewhere on the network, disruption
OL,8,Fis expected between Hastings and
OL,9,FAshford until 14:00. Lines have now
OL,10,Freopened following a fault with the
OL,11,Fsignalling systems.
OL,13,FThere is also a points failure between
OL,14,FThree Bridges and Horsham, meaning
OL,15,Ftrains running through these stations
OL,16,Fwill be cancelled, delayed or revised.
OL,17,FThis is expected until 13:00.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G8/13
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786717111
OL,3,CMajor travel disruption expected
OL,4,C'until further notice' after train
OL,5,Cderailment
OL,7,FIn a statement last night on the train
OL,8,Fderailment, Lucy McAuliffe, Network
OL,9,FRail's Sussex Route Director said:
OL,10,F"Firstly I am shocked and saddened by
OL,11,Fwhat's happened today. My immediate
OL,12,Fthoughts and that of our teams are
OL,13,Fwith the injured, their family and
OL,14,Ffriends and with all those who have
OL,15,Fbeen caught up and affected by this
OL,16,Fincident.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G9/13
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786717111
OL,3,CMajor travel disruption expected
OL,4,C'until further notice' after train
OL,5,Cderailment
OL,7,F"Our teams are working closely with
OL,8,Findustry partners, response teams and
OL,9,Fthe emergency services to ensure
OL,10,Feveryone receives the care and support
OL,11,Fthey need. That is our absolute
OL,12,Fpriority right now.
OL,14,F"The railway between Lewes and
OL,15,FHaywards Heath is closed, and is
OL,16,Flikely to remain closed while the
OL,17,Femergency response continues and
OL,18,Fspecialist teams carry out the complex
OL,19,Ftask of assessing damage to the train
OL,20,Fand infrastructure.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G10/13
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38211
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786717111
OL,3,CMajor travel disruption expected
OL,4,C'until further notice' after train
OL,5,Cderailment
OL,7,F"I understand that people will have
OL,8,Flots of questions about what has
OL,9,Fhappened today. I'd like to reassure
OL,10,Feveryone that we are working closely
OL,11,Fwith the Rail Accident Investigation
OL,12,FBranch, who are on site to establish
OL,13,Fexactly what's happened. At the
OL,14,Fmoment, it would be inappropriate to
OL,15,Fcomment as to the cause of this
OL,16,Fincident, but more information will be
OL,17,Fprovided as soon as we can.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G11/13
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38212
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786717111
OL,3,CMajor travel disruption expected
OL,4,C'until further notice' after train
OL,5,Cderailment
OL,7,F"I'd like to thank the emergency
OL,8,Fservices and the wider railway family
OL,9,Ffor their professionalism and swift
OL,10,Fresponse today.
OL,12,F"This is an evolving and complex
OL,13,Fsituation. We will provide updates as
OL,14,Fsoon as we have a clearer
OL,15,Funderstanding of the recovery work
OL,16,Frequired and when the railway can
OL,17,Fsafely reopen. In the meantime,
OL,18,Fcustomers should check with their
OL,19,Ftrain operator for the latest travel
OL,20,Fadvice before they travel.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G12/13
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38213
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786717111
OL,3,CMajor travel disruption expected
OL,4,C'until further notice' after train
OL,5,Cderailment
OL,7,F"I can only apologise to those of you
OL,8,Fwho have been impacted by this
OL,9,Fincident, but I must thank the local
OL,10,Fcommunity and the response teams for
OL,11,Feverything that they have done to
OL,12,Fsupport the response to this
OL,13,Fsituation."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G13/13
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
